      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working at a repair shop here in seoul and i just found a really badly swollen li-ion battery in a customer's phone. it's looking like it might pop if i touch it too much. what are the immediate safety steps i should take and how do i dispose of it properly without causing a fire?",
